@KiComLibBackend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5229

### API info (v2, read permission)
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List symbols (from head view)
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/symbol
Accept: application/json

### Get symbol by id (raw data)
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/symbol/1
Accept: application/json

### Symbol preview SVG
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/symbol/preview/1
Accept: text/plain

### Symbol history
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/symbol/1/history
Accept: application/json

### Symbol revision
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/symbol/1/revision/1
Accept: application/json

### Symbol unified diff (flat object)
# Response shape: { "format": "unified", "diff": "--- …\n+++ …" }
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/symbol/1/diff?from=1&to=2
Accept: application/json

### Footprint unified diff (flat object, same shape as symbol /diff)
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/footprint/1/diff?from=1&to=2
Accept: application/json

### List footprints (includes models[] per row, same shape as detail)
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/footprint
Accept: application/json

### Get footprint (includes models[])
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/footprint/1
Accept: application/json

### Footprint filter by library file
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/footprint?_filterby=LibraryFileId&_filter=1
Accept: application/json

### List model3d
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/model3d
Accept: application/json

### model3d filter by path
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/model3d?_filterby=path&_filter=Package_DFN_QFN/QFN-16.step
Accept: application/json

### model3d search by filename
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/model3d/searchbyfilename?_filename=QFN-16.step&_path=Package_DFN_QFN
Accept: application/json

### HEAD blob exists
HEAD {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/blob/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef

### Batch blob exists
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/blob/exists
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef"
]

### PUT blob (raw body; set X-Media-Type)
PUT {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/blob/e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855
Content-Type: application/octet-stream
X-Media-Type: text/x-kicad-sexpr

### GET blob
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/blob/e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855

### Create commit
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "example commit",
  "author": "Michael",
  "client": "http-client",
  "baseCommitId": 1,
  "changes": [
    {
      "entity": "symbol",
      "op": "create",
      "blobHash": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "libraryFileId": 2,
      "name": "ExampleSymbol",
      "reference": "U",
      "inBom": true,
      "onBoard": true
    }
  ]
}

### List commits
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/commit?_limit=50&_offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Get commit
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/commit/1
Accept: application/json

### Commit diff (array of per-entity diffs)
# Response shape: [ { "entity": "symbol", "id": 1, "revisionNo": 2, "diff": { "format": "unified", "diff": "…" } }, … ]
# Note: per-entity GET /api/{entity}/{id}/diff returns the flat diff object directly;
# GET /api/commit/{id}/diff wraps each in { entity, id, revisionNo, diff }.
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/commit/1/diff
Accept: application/json

### Sync changes since commit
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/sync/changes?sinceCommitId=0
Accept: application/json

### Legacy write endpoints return 410
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/symbol
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
PUT {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/footprint/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### KiCad HTTP library parts list
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/v1/parts/category/1.json
Accept: application/json

### Projects API info includes projectsApiVersion
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List git hosts (admin)
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/git-host
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a self-hosted GitLab host (admin)
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/git-host
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "gitlab",
  "name": "Example GitLab",
  "webUrl": "https://gitlab.example.com",
  "sshHost": "ssh://git@gitlab.example.com:22",
  "allowHttp": false
}

### Create an HTTPS credential (admin). The token is not returned.
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/git-credential
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "name": "deploy-token",
  "kind": "https_token",
  "username": "gitlab+deploy-token-1",
  "secret": "glpat-example-a1b2"
}

### Generate an SSH deploy key (admin). publicKey is returned once in the create response and stored.
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/git-credential
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "name": "deploy-key",
  "kind": "ssh_key",
  "generate": true
}

### Test a clone URL (admin)
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/git-repository/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "credentialId": 1,
  "cloneUrl": "https://gitlab.com/group/project.git"
}

### Create a repository (admin). webhook.secret is shown only in this response.
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/git-repository
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "credentialId": 1,
  "cloneUrl": "https://gitlab.com/group/project.git",
  "trackedBranches": ["release/*"],
  "tagPattern": "v*",
  "syncMode": "webhook"
}

### Sync a repository now (admin) → 202
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/git-repository/1/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List readable projects
GET {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/project?status=development&q=main
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a project (admin)
POST {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/project
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repositoryId": 1,
  "projectFile": "hw/main/main.kicad_pro",
  "name": "Main",
  "status": "development"
}

### Replace project group access (admin)
PUT {{KiComLibBackend_HostAddress}}/api/project/1/access
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "groupId": 2, "canWrite": false },
  { "groupId": 3, "canWrite": true }
]

